{'symbol': 'BLK', 'date': '2023-04-24 18:49:00', 'title': 'BLACKROCK® CANADA ANNOUNCES FINAL APRIL CASH DISTRIBUTIONS FOR THE ISHARES® PREMIUM MONEY MARKET ETF', 'text': 'TORONTO, APRIL 24, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- BLACKROCK ASSET MANAGEMENT CANADA LIMITED (“BLACKROCK CANADA”), AN INDIRECT, WHOLLY-OWNED SUBSIDIARY OF BLACKROCK, INC. (NYSE: BLK), TODAY ANNOUNCED THE FINAL APRIL 2023 CASH DISTRIBUTIONS FOR THE ISHARES PREMIUM MONEY MARKET ETF. UNITHOLDERS OF RECORD ON APRIL 25, 2023 WILL RECEIVE CASH DISTRIBUTIONS PAYABLE ON APRIL 28, 2023.'}